@page "/"

<HeadContent>
    <title>Connor Gamble</title>
    <meta name="description" content="C# Developer and avid gamer" />
    <meta name="keywords" content="Connor Gamble" />
    <meta name="author" content="Connor Gamble" />
</HeadContent>

<!-- Hero Section -->
<div class="space-y-2 pb-4 pt-6 md:space-y-3">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-9 tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl sm:leading-10 md:text-5xl md:leading-12">
        Yo, I'm <span class="text-primary-500">Connor</span>
    </h1>
</div>

<!-- About Me Section -->
<div class="flex flex-col-reverse items-start space-y-4 xl:grid xl:grid-cols-3 xl:gap-x-8 xl:space-y-0">
    <div class="prose max-w-none pb-4 pt-4 xl:col-span-2">
        <p class="text-base text-gray-300 mb-4">
            Whether I’m hacking away at technical debt in an older C# codebase or building something new with Blazor and AWS, I find it's best to approach problems head on and iterate until there's a solution which feels right.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base text-gray-300 mb-4">
            The same mindset carries into my game projects, regardless of engine, where I enjoy exploring ideas, improving the things I make and learning new tools.
        </p>
        <!-- Core Skills -->
        <div class="mb-4">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3">Core Skillset</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="skill-tag">C#</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">ASP.NET Core</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">ASP.NET Framework</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">Blazor Server</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">SQL</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">MongoDb</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">AWS Lambda</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">AWS S3</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">Azure DevOps</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">Git</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">Godot</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">Unity</span>
                <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact Information Card -->
    <div class="w-full xl:col-span-1">
        <div class="items-start space-y-2 xl:grid xl:grid-cols-1 xl:gap-x-8 xl:space-y-0">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-3 pt-0">
                <img src="images/profile.png" alt="Chibi Connor"
                     class="h-32 w-32 rounded-full object-cover shadow-lg border-2 border-primary-500" />

                <div class="space-y-2 text-center">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Connor Gamble</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">C# developer and backend enthusiast</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>